sequenceDiagram
 participant U as GitGit Client
 participant S as MinIOS3 CAS
 participant G as GitGit CommitCoordinator
 participant R as GitGit RefStore
 U->>S: Upload chunks + Seal Manifest
 S-->>U: DurableReceipt(manifest, epoch, expiry, signature)
 U->>G: Commit(expectedRef, manifests, receipts, idempotencyKey)
 G->>S: Verify Receipts + Policy Epoch
 alt Receipts are valid
   S-->>G: Valid
   G->>R: Atomic Commit + Ref CAS + Outbox
   alt CAS succeeds
     R-->>G: Committed(revision)
     G-->>U: CommitId + RefRevision
   else conflict
     R-->>G: RefConflict
     G-->>U: 409 + currentRef
   end
 else Invalid/Missing Chunk
   S-->>G: Refuse
   G-->>U: Error; old Ref unchanged
 end
